  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup red lentils",
    "2 cups water",
    "1 teaspoon kosher salt, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cyw0wieG1LIxWBG5BpctxKEGOyE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8542186-lentil-flatbread-step-01-4100a7ef81ee4d249e953e06958e8748.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8542186/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add lentils and water to a blender, or food processor and soak for at least 3 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Km3sXW-jPjprrq37aOKwVRhSfoQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8542186-lentil-flatbread-step-02-0f92950af3e74350a28ce809f9aab0ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8542186/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend lentils until they are very smooth. Season with salt. (Batter can be used immediately, but for best results refrigerate overnight).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sArSbUSdBN6QAvX5a5PBqj9-Gyc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8542186-lentil-flatbread-step-03-d91b987ed9424d30bff9ca53daf96e8f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8542186/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To cook, heat a non-stick pan on medium-high. Grease lightly with olive oil and allow to get hot. Add 1/4 to 1/3 cup of batter to the hot pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OwCWhnCjrg7gHZmEaIprwmEcPe0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8542186-lentil-flatbread-step-04-18eb2e6e4ed049188e296c2696de20e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8542186/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the bottom of a ladle or spoon to spread out into a 5 or 6 inch circle. Lower heat to medium, and adjust from there if needed. Cook the first side for about 1 1/2 to 2 minutes, before flipping over.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LGKECqCuKrgGB2UnmYBw1nHmFMM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8542186-lentil-flatbread-step-05-95b431f189334172bbed24fde7836d1d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8542186/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook the second side for about 2 minutes, before transferring to a plate. Keep warm flatbreads covered with a towel while cooking and stacking.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XFj3PSe0NsoUm4IbHZpjFcGnP4U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8542186-lentil-flatbread-step-06-076c3cf88f744635b36335009264fe7d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8542186/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
